rms  seasonal theme for vanguard and warzone  the trailer ended with the ferocious  roar of an unknown creature in the call  of duty twitter account has since added  a mysterious sound clip that continues  to point towards the season of monsters  just listening to the sound clip doesn't  provide an actual clue but youtuber  prestigious key has discovered a hidden  message by running the sound clip  through a spectrogram which provides a  visual voice print hidden in the audio  the spectrogram revealed season 3's  hidden message monsters are real having  towering monsters arrive in warzone  might seem a little outlandish but  leaguers previously claimed activision  had planned for a major event with  hollywood monsters such as godzilla and  king kong  twitter user b playing games even  replied to prestigious keys tweet adding  that the sound seems to be a match for  orca from 2019's godzilla king of  monsters call of duty's monstrous season  3 is scheduled to start on april 27th  now let's switch gears to a topic that  everyone loves free stuff from now until  april 21st at 8 a.m pacific time 11 a.m  eastern you can claim xcom 2 and  insurmountable on the epic game store  xcom 2 is one of the best tactic games  of all time it's set in a futuristic  world where aliens have control of earth  with brilliantly designed maps and  turn-based combat that test your wits  and forethought xcom 2 is a must play  game for all strategy fans  insurmountable is an interesting  roguelike that places you in the shoes  of a climber who scales monmouth  mountains in precarious weather and  conditions insurmountable has  choice-based gameplay mechanics that  make each run feel unique but alright  folks hit the comments section let me  know your eye color i'll see you  tomorrow
 

